{"steam_appid":3385970,"steam_name":"Beyond Sandbox","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3385970/2082239318/4d027acbcca41eceaeb0ad771c02a05c0b27b823/1777343003/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777343628","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257327851/804ea28f5f03ac1e9a4629f208c053e632d30182/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777343628","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/03f15c1464a25cae08b2627943c3ad015bee9422/ss_03f15c1464a25cae08b2627943c3ad015bee9422.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778514258","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/c2ee3d6be083e7ad37b8b8bd7d44e7d2b34e10da/ss_c2ee3d6be083e7ad37b8b8bd7d44e7d2b34e10da.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778514258","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/e7760e3491c6cd95bd739d23d0cb9dd86cb2d80e/ss_e7760e3491c6cd95bd739d23d0cb9dd86cb2d80e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778514258","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/da7827c61ede6318c837907dc4703157705878f6/ss_da7827c61ede6318c837907dc4703157705878f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778514258","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/ee8fed50dc85a5e3884140d2fc6fd2251e270ed2/ss_ee8fed50dc85a5e3884140d2fc6fd2251e270ed2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778514258"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Beyond Sandbox!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is instrumental in shaping our roadmap. There is so much planned and we're excited to see everything our modding community builds alongside us. This is just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.webm?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Sandbox is a multiplayer VR modding platform powered by Unreal Engine 5. With advanced physics, detailed VR interactions and the creativity of our modding community, anything is possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Physics Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics based interactions in both single-player and multiplayer! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.webm?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics is more fun with friends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/2141e3e954524c33357cbb3102b6b649.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/2141e3e954524c33357cbb3102b6b649.webm?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/2141e3e954524c33357cbb3102b6b649.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modding Platform for Endless Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Sandbox was built with mods in mind from day 1. Our Reality SDK enables the most creatively talented modders to build anything they can dream of, giving players endless content! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/18bb8fc381450e1bc91bcd0aa104dfd2.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/18bb8fc381450e1bc91bcd0aa104dfd2.webm?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/18bb8fc381450e1bc91bcd0aa104dfd2.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starter Experiences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using our Reality SDK, this first launch comes with the following starter experiences: Sandbox, PvP Shooter Modes, Zombie Horde Mode. And there is so much more to explore thanks to our modding community! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3d476c2b1670f7ddcb886b71d563554a.poster.avif?t=1778514258\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3d476c2b1670f7ddcb886b71d563554a.webm?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3d476c2b1670f7ddcb886b71d563554a.mp4?t=1778514258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being a part of our journey from the start. Big things to come!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 Super / AMD RX 5700 XT (8 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest Link / Air Link, SteamVR, Virtual Desktop. Room Scale or Standing.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Virtual Desktop: set OpenXR Runtime to &quot;VDXR&quot; in Virtual Desktop Streamer settings. SteamVR: disable &quot;Meta XR Plugin Compatibility&quot; in SteamVR settings.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12600K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 4070 / AMD RX 7800 XT (12 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest Link / Air Link, SteamVR, Virtual Desktop. Room Scale or Standing.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Virtual Desktop: set OpenXR Runtime to &quot;VDXR&quot; in Virtual Desktop Streamer settings. SteamVR: disable &quot;Meta XR Plugin Compatibility&quot; in SteamVR settings.</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Atlas XR"],"publishers":["2080 Games"],"release_date":"27 Apr, 2026"}